WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.790
- We both started on "Idol."

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:02.623
- [Kellie] Yes.

00:00:02.623 --> 00:00:04.403
- And I had no idea until
literally last night

00:00:04.403 --> 00:00:07.180
that one of your audition songs
was "Since You Been Gone."

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:08.013
- Yes,

00:00:08.013 --> 00:00:08.846
Oh my gosh.
- I love that!

00:00:08.846 --> 00:00:09.679
I didn't know that.

00:00:09.679 --> 00:00:12.070
- Yes, well big fan.

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:13.300
- Well, thank you.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:15.060
- No, I remember auditioning, you know,

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:16.500
there's so many different rounds.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:17.440
- [Kelly] Before you even get to the.

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:19.450
- Before you even get to
Paula, Randy, and Simon,

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:21.540
which we had the original three.

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:22.540
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh.

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:23.585
- [Kellie] My gosh.

00:00:23.585 --> 00:00:24.660
- That's so cute.
- Time doesn't slow down

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:25.703
for nobody, does it.

00:00:26.705 --> 00:00:27.704
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:27.704 --> 00:00:28.537
But so, we go in.

00:00:28.537 --> 00:00:31.020
I actually auditioned
with "The Sweetest Thing"

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:31.853
by Juice Newton.

00:00:31.853 --> 00:00:32.686
- Yeah.

00:00:32.686 --> 00:00:34.010
- Went through to the next round

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:36.390
and then sang that one
again and I thought,

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:37.640
maybe this'll be good.

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:39.080
Keep doin' this one.

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:44.080
And I think it was Paula had
asked me to sing something,

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.290
could you sing something pop?

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:48.800
And I went, I just
started singing your song.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:51.380
And I was terrified because.

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:52.360
- You picked,

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:53.810
I mean I gotta be real with you,

00:00:53.810 --> 00:00:56.210
that would not be my
go-to for an audition.

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:57.581
- I mean, I didn't know

00:00:57.581 --> 00:00:59.640
and you were the first
person that came to mind.

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:01.767
And then 20 seconds of something else,

00:01:01.767 --> 00:01:04.280
and so I sang "Broken
Wing" by Martina McBride.

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:05.974
- Good song, good pick.

00:01:05.974 --> 00:01:07.008
They had me do the same thing.

00:01:07.008 --> 00:01:07.847
- You're a good luck charm
- They had all of us do

00:01:07.847 --> 00:01:08.750
different songs
- for me.

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:10.230
It got me through to the next round.

00:01:10.230 --> 00:01:11.560
- Well that's awesome.

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:12.930
They had all of us do that though.

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:14.270
Everybody thinks it's like one song.

00:01:14.270 --> 00:01:15.800
I had to sing like three different ones

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:16.633
even to get, yeah.

00:01:16.633 --> 00:01:19.400
I was like am I still proving
that I can sing on key here?

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:20.250
What's happening.

00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:24.017
- This is amazing backstage
dish to "American Idol."

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:26.629
We are spilling the tea today.

00:01:26.629 --> 00:01:28.270
- [Kelly] We are!

00:01:28.270 --> 00:01:29.655
- Everywhere!

00:01:29.655 --> 00:01:31.012
- (laughs) I love you.

